      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is an oasis of French cuisine.' Nagiyev boasts about his restaurant, comparing it to an oasis to impress his guest.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Анклав качества.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A bastion of quality.' Nagiyev continues his grand speech, using high-class words to emphasize the premium nature of his establishment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Сколько сил вложено сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So much effort went into this place.' Nagiyev dramatically points out all the hard work he poured into building the business.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Официант, как родной ребенок.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A waiter is like my own child.' Nagiyev flatters himself as a paternal figure to his staff, comparing the servers to his own children.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "О, привет, Виляш.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, hi, Vilyash.' Nagiyev casually greets a passing waitress, entirely butchering her real name in the process.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я Настя, вообще-то.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Nastya, actually.' Nastya awkwardly corrects him, pointing out her actual name while trying not to offend her boss.",
      "gap": 0.4
