      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Новенькая, наверное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She must be new.' Nagiyev brushes off his mistake by assuming she was just hired, skipping the verb 'to be' entirely.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ну, пойдем дальше.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, let' Nagiyev smoothly moves the tour along, eager to show off more of the dining room.",
